HDSatelit Image
===============

Linux image with enigma2 (Python 3) for the Amiko Viper 4K V20 satellite
receiver, made by Monea Software for HD Satelit (hdsatelit.com).

README.md (Romanian, then English) has the license, the files in this
repository that carry their own license, the build steps and the
installation on the receiver.

License: GNU GPL version 2 only (see LICENSE and LICENSE.GPLv2).

The build notes for Dreambox and Ubuntu 10.04 that this file held in the
2011 source tree no longer apply to this code.
